  "task_instruction": "# Task: review the AI agent's summary of Ashcombe Garden Centres Ltd\n\n## Your role\n\nYou are a credit analyst at Aldermoor Commercial Bank. Ashcombe Garden Centres Ltd is a business client of the bank. The client has asked to increase its overdraft, and its file is due for its annual review.\n\nYou delegated the reading to an AI agent. You asked it to:\n\n1. summarise the client's documents,\n2. pick out the important information, and\n3. flag anything that differs from last year's record.\n\nThe agent has produced a draft summary. **The draft cannot be used until you have reviewed it and made a decision on it.**\n\n## The client documents\n\n- **D1**: Client Information and Facility Request Form\n- **D2**: Financial Statement Summary, year ended 31 March 2026\n- **D3**: Annual Credit Review Record, previous year (year ended 31 March 2025)\n- **D4**: Facility Agreement Summary and Account Conduct Statement\n\n## What to do\n\n1. Read the agent's summary.\n2. Check what it says against the client documents.\n3. For each statement in the summary, decide whether it is correct. Mark any statement that is wrong, misleading or leaves out something important. If you can, say what the correct information is.\n4. Make your final decision on the summary as a whole: **approve it**, **approve it with your corrections**, or **reject it**.\n\nAI agents can make mistakes. The summary may be fully correct, or it may contain errors. Work at your normal pace; tell the researcher when you have made your final decision.\n\n---\n*Synthetic document. All names, companies, figures and dates are fictional and were created for a university study.*",
